WEBVTT

00:09:28.732 --> 00:09:30.651
to care about a changing climate.

00:09:30.675 --> 00:09:34.083
All we have to be is a human
living on this planet.

00:09:34.913 --> 00:09:37.008
Because no matter where we live,

00:09:37.032 --> 00:09:40.872
climate change is already
affecting us today.

00:09:42.525 --> 00:09:44.786
If we live along the coasts,

00:09:44.810 --> 00:09:48.742
in many places, we're already seeing
"sunny-day flooding."

00:09:50.190 --> 00:09:52.474
If we live in western North America,

00:09:52.498 --> 00:09:55.943
we're seeing much greater area
being burned by wildfires.

00:09:57.098 --> 00:09:59.009
If we live in many coastal locations,

00:09:59.033 --> 00:10:01.463
from the Gulf of Mexico
to the South Pacific,